  "label": "Antisemitic Concept: Physical Feature Caricatures",
  "description": "This is an antisemitic trope that falsely claims Jewish people have exaggerated physical features, such as large noses, which are used to dehumanize and marginalize them. This concept is used to justify hatred and violence against Jewish people by portraying them as ugly, inferior figures who must be eliminated. The meme's text implies this by suggesting that Jewish people are 'pretending to be white' and are therefore a threat to the world.",
